						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Greetings everyone!<br /><br />I have 100k platinum that I would like to trade for platinum on FV.&nbsp; I understand that I may have to take a loss but that&#039;s ok with me.<br /><br />Just send me an email at <a href="mailto:lnyaniel@gmail.com">lnyaniel@gmail.com</a> and we will work something out.&nbsp; <br /><br />I have higher level characters on FV and am part of a well respected guild there so you will see that I am not scamming.&nbsp; Willing to use 3rd party people too <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />Thanks!<br />Lynn<br /></td>
