							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">To be honest I really like the idea of the merge.  There will be more people for me to level with before joining a guild <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />My main is now 25th level cleric! Wooo Hoo!! hehe<br /><br />edit..&nbsp; I wonder what a merge will do to market prices?<br /><br /></td>
