						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">LOL - beastlord...&nbsp; nice class - very nice - but not what I want to play <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />Hiya Brihn! Great grouping with you on the days we spent together - I should be on tonight if you haven&#039;t gotten too far ahead of me in level with your bard!&nbsp; I&#039;m still 8th level so I still won&#039;t lose exp or have to go on a cr either - after you get us killed...&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm32.gif" alt="cwm32" border="0" /><br /><br />As far as my friends are concerned they are both in different raiding guilds and for the moment I am not interested in raiding.&nbsp; Not like a level 21 wizzy is going to be much help on a Bertox raid ;)&nbsp; Unless you want her there for amusement lol&nbsp; (getting into PoTranq would be a little difficult too)...&nbsp; <br /><br />29th level is the key though you&#039;re right.&nbsp; I can still kite in certain areas and still get a rush with it at 21 but not like 29 when (as long as I have the mana pool) I can Octal kite&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/devil1.gif" alt="Devil" border="0" /><br /><br />My 2 friends both just started up wizzy&#039;s too and are pl&#039;ing one to 29 so that he can pl both of ours to 29...&nbsp; then the FUN begins!&nbsp; 3 Quad kiting wizzies should be a blast!&nbsp; (Bad pun - sorry)...<br /><br />Again... thank you everyone for the replies.&nbsp; It&#039;s nice to see that a community is still existant after WoW and EQ2 took a number of players from it.&nbsp; But be heartened...&nbsp; I am an EX-EQ2 player - and more will be coming back <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br /> <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiliedisco1.gif" alt="smiliedisco1" border="0" /><br /><br />Lynn<br /><br /></td>
