						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Oh I wasn&#039;t judging anyone or anything...&nbsp; I just noticed that a lot of guilds are 45+ or are disbanding...<br /><br />What is a lower level person suppossed to do?<br /><br />Thanks for the replies&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm20.gif" alt="cwm20" border="0" /><br /><br />Lynn</td>
