							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
								on: January 31, 2005, 12:16:12 pm
							</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Greetings from a new old player!<br /><br />Just found the boards this morning and decided to take a look at how people treat others on this server before making my presence known  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /><br /><br />Currently I have my 21 wizzy Lnyaniel (can&#039;t get to 29 fast enough lol), my 8 Enchantress Azzdana (non twink), and my 31 SK - Kire.  I may decide to pull a cleric out of my hat or a mage - just haven&#039;t decided what yet ;)<br /><br />Let&#039;s see... about me...  My first and only character for a LONG time was on Firiona Vie - a wizardess named Lnyaniel (go fiigure).  I quit playing EQ to go and play EQ2 - I was suckered by the sales department - please forgive me!  So now I am coming back to EQ.  It just couldn&#039;t hold my interest like EQ does and it was beginning to really feel like work playing there.<br /><br />I came to Rodcet Nife because a couple of real life friends play here and invited me.  Of course I&#039;m a little twinked (nothing major and NOT my Enchantress who has just finished her newbie armor quests! woohoo!).   <br /><br />The RL friends are high levels (70 &amp; 67and different guilds) so I came here looking for a guild that would have me.  I am a little worried about finding a decent guild now though!  It seems that the only way to get into a guild here is to be 46+ level  <br /><br />Maybe someone can point me to a guild that has a great reputation that would not mind me trying out to join them? At the moment I plan on playing my wizzy as my main - but I might go the cleric route just to be able to find groups lol<br /><br />Hugs to all,<br />Lynn<br /><br /><br />PS - I wanted to add that YES I have looked at a lot of the Guilds recruitment posts - but am not having luck finding what I am looking for ;)<br /><br /></td>
						</tr>
